# OPIc Sample Answer — Day50

## Changes in My Neighborhood

> My neighborhood has changed a lot since I was a child.
>
> It used to be a quiet residential area, but now there are many restaurants, cafes, and stores nearby.
>
> One major change is that public transportation has become much more convenient. There are more buses, and it is easier to get around without a car.
>
> Compared to the past, the neighborhood is definitely more crowded, but it is also more convenient.
>
> I think the changes have had a positive impact on my daily life.

---

## Useful Expressions

### It has changed a lot since I was a child.

어렸을 때 이후로 많이 변했어요.

### It used to be a quiet residential area.

예전에는 조용한 주거 지역이었어요.

### One major change is that ~.

가장 큰 변화 중 하나는 ~예요.

### Compared to the past, ~.

과거와 비교하면 ~예요.

### It has had a positive impact on ~.

~에 긍정적인 영향을 미쳤어요.

---

## 답변 확장 포인트

실제 자신의 동네에 맞춰 다음 요소를 바꿔 말하기.

* restaurants
* cafes
* public transportation
* new buildings
* traffic
* population
* convenience stores
* parks

외운 답변을 그대로 말하기보다 **과거 → 변화 → 구체적 사례 → 나에게 미친 영향** 순서로 말하는 것이 핵심.
